From 46fed97999b25a43c6d28f63919fa6dd94640468 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Tomas=20Franz=C3=A9n?= <tomas@tomasf.se>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:54:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] tvOS platform (godotengine/godot#123885) adapted to
 4.7.2-stable

Applies sanarena's tvos-port on top of 4.7.2-stable. The platform keeps
4.7.2's layout: the shared Swift app entry in drivers/apple_embedded and
the GDTApplicationDelegate / app_delegate_service names, so the per-platform
app_tvos.swift and delegate subclass are dropped and SCsub lists sources
like visionOS does. Template-manager download entries are left out.
